From 19b8a00a44b48e32b88c4867ca1bf5250f0c4064 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jiaqi Cheng <chengjiaqi3@huawei.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 14:28:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ub:ubctl:Provide a user interface for ubase query
 function..

tool inclusion
category: feature
bugzilla: https://atomgit.com/openeuler/ubctl/issues/32
CVE: NA

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

ub_fwctl only provides one interface to the outside world,
and determines which interface to call on ubase based on
custom command word parameters.
ub_fwctl associates the device name with a unique UE device instance in
the kernel state driver and calls the UE level interface of UBASE.

Signed-off-by: Jiaqi Cheng <chengjiaqi3@huawei.com>
